  "validation_domain": "Valid real CCL Parameter/controller objects; own vs foreign controller, messages kEdit(2),kChanged(3) and ignored others; selection parameter membership; tags1000..1004 and outside; exact input_bank/show_auto names and other names; positive/zero/negative/NaN values; optional tag1009 absent/present. Includes exact included addGroup/onObserveredParamChange with same owner; native layout/hardware and original ordinary return excluded. Tested bounded cases and exact compared observations are in replay.json; negative missing-tag600 case is separately preserved with original-invalid-domain correction.",
  "limitations": [
    "Portable source port only. Ordinary original returns remain unresolved/unencoded; source choices are void. Original inheritance, storage layout, ownership, calling convention, ARM32 binary interoperability and hardware behavior are not established.",
    "Native execution runs each assigned original body with documented synthetic memory and captured external calls. No Core binary body executes. Actual CCL 5.0.0 objects and current application providers execute in the source replay; native boundary captures are test-only, not production providers.",
    "Comparison covers direct application-call entry ordering, selectGroup selection before doselect, own paramChanged tag1009 result, observer group603/mapping6 values, and bit-exact addGroup numeric values/bounded names. It excludes full nested original-provider traces, callback reentrancy, concurrency, exceptions and allocator failures.",
    "Every child traversed by updateGroups requires a tag600 parameter. Original helper faults at0x92918 for a missing tag600; portable ASan caller chain agrees. Initial requested safe full-tree case was unsupported by original behavior; Root approved appended domain correction. No null-safe helper behavior was invented.",
    "Real ParamList cannot normally contain null entries; nullable source/destination getter results are bounded by missing-tag600 source and source/destination count mismatches. NaN value propagation and string type4 skip are covered; exotic custom parameter classes are excluded.",
    "Local validation refreshed two existing members in a scratch copy of baseline CS18 role archive. This is not canonical CMake/full Linux/compile-once proof. Root must rebuild existing OBJECT partitions and link adapter solely through the role target.",
    "Canonical replay validates 1507 nonempty state observations from 1895 cases. Remaining388 cases retain original instrumented local proof only; no unavailable traces are counted as canonical state validation.",
    "No production instrumentation flags or CPP duplication are required. Canonical driver defines no __cyg_profile callbacks; local symbol checks reject references in refreshed production members and definitions in its executable."
